# Haruka Scene v7
# Navigation and AI check (2026-11-21, Docs/Navigation_AI.md N5). Press Play: Walker (Nav Agent + AI Brain) patrols the
# actors tagged NavGoal in name order. NavGoalA is on the raised platform behind the wall, so Walker walks around the
# wall end and up the ramp. The nav mesh is baked into NavProbe.hnav (console: nav.build); nav.debug 1 draws it.
# The navigation test loads this scene and checks the baked file and where Walker is after 600 frames.
